<title>USA: St Joseph hogs off $1.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs off $1.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said compared with</p>
<p>Friday, barrows and gilts were $1.50 lower. Top $50.00 per</p>
<p>cwt.</p>
<p>Holiday and slow dressed pork trade curbed early week</p>
<p>demand for hogs.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    230-270 lbs    49.50-50.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3    270-290 lbs    48.00-49.00</p>
<p>Sows - off $0.50/up $4.00. Top $56.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-2    300-450 lbs    42.00</p>
<p>		  450-500 lbs    46.00</p>
<p>    US 1-3    500-550 lbs    54.00</p>
<p>		  550-700 lbs    55.00-56.00</p>
<p>    Boars:	 300-700 lbs    39.00</p>
<p>		     200-300 lbs    40.00</p>
</text>
